  "missing_documentation": [],
  "rationale": "The NCD explicitly requires plasma exchange to be used as a last resort treatment for life-threatening rheumatoid vasculitis. The case facts indicate the patient has not received any prior treatment for vasculitis, and plasma exchange is being requested as first-line therapy before attempting conventional treatments like corticosteroids and cyclophosphamide. Since the patient has not failed conventional therapy, the coverage criterion is not met."
}

{
